  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_3090.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado diversos grupos rocieros, cuadros de baile, carruajes&nbsp;y caballistas han realizado una romer&iacute;a hasta el paraje del Salvador, en Onda, por los caminos del t&eacute;rmino municipal, tras salir del Recinto Multiusos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3084.jpg\" alt=\"img_3084\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3085.jpg\" alt=\"img_3085\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3086.jpg\" alt=\"img_3086\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3087.jpg\" alt=\"img_3087\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3088.jpg\" alt=\"img_3088\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3089.jpg\" alt=\"img_3089\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3090.jpg\" alt=\"img_3090\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3091.jpg\" alt=\"img_3091\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriarocieraelsalvador/img_3092.jpg\" alt=\"img_3092\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976